  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 301.13 “Master plumber” means “master plumber” as defined in RSA 153:27, XII, namely, \"any person, firm, corporation, or limited liability company that, as a business, hires or employs a person or persons to do plumbing work, or, without hiring any person, does that work as a principal business or as auxiliary to a principal business for its own account.\"\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 303.13)",
